WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:09.444
I had been waiting for my birthday.

2
00:00:09.445 --> 00:00:14.063
I was born in the summer.

3
00:00:14.064 --> 00:00:19.685
Hana: All right! My birthday falls on a Saturday this year!

4
00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:22.895
Bada: Your birthday? When is it?

5
00:00:22.896 --> 00:00:25.054
Hana: On July 13.

6
00:00:25.055 --> 00:00:32.899
I am going to have a great birthday party!

7
00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:35.594
Bada: What about my birthday?

8
00:00:35.595 --> 00:00:37.321
When is it?

9
00:00:37.322 --> 00:00:39.200
Hana: It's in the winter.

10
00:00:39.201 --> 00:00:42.514
Go and ask Mom about it.

11
00:00:42.515 --> 00:00:43.936
Bada: Mom!

12
00:00:43.937 --> 00:00:45.422
Mom: Yes, dear.

13
00:00:45.423 --> 00:00:48.012
Bada: When is my birthday?

14
00:00:48.013 --> 00:00:53.332
Mom: Your birthday is on December 29.

15
00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:55.225
Bada: Is that soon?

16
00:00:55.226 --> 00:00:58.812
Mom: No, dear. It is still months away.

17
00:00:58.813 --> 00:01:01.486
Bada: How long is that?

18
00:01:01.487 --> 00:01:08.901
Mom: Hmm. You have to wait about 180 days.

19
00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:14.245
Bada: 180 days? Wow!

20
00:01:14.246 --> 00:01:19.401
Hana: Mom, can I invite some friends to my birthday party?

21
00:01:19.402 --> 00:01:23.448
Mom: Sure. Just let me know how many will be coming.

22
00:01:23.449 --> 00:01:26.023
Hana: Thanks, Mom!

23
00:01:26.024 --> 00:01:33.739
July is my favorite month because it is the month in which I was born.

24
00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:36.802
When were you born?
